note The graph's side of a focus change, steered by who caused it: a click on a node (Steering::Click) keeps the camera and the root; an arrow-key walk (Steering::Keys) asks the camera to look at the node and keeps the root; a focus from outside the graph asks for a look and drops the kept root, so the new symbol can become the root. The steering is consumed either way.

