note The graph reads the same fields and keeps no selection of its own: every frame it derives its node set from the selected path and the focused symbol, so it cannot disagree with the document or the steps list. The path is drawn whenever one is selected, step or no step: selecting a symbol off the path from outside the graph adds it as another root beside the path rather than replacing it, and GraphState keeps it as the root while the reader moves inside the graph.

