note The selection and everything that moves with it: the centre tab and the ticket of the last request for it, the path and step (as slots in the map), the target step added steps hang under, the focused symbol, the open file and its line selection, the pending scrolls of the Source view and the document (each with a ticket, so an older request cannot clear a newer one), the step at the top of the document and the one the steps list last scrolled to, and the history. Views read it through accessors; only nav.rs writes it.

